    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to have Xero charge up a nuclear beam. Place a token on this stat block. The next time Xero is spotlighted, you can spend this token and unleash a beam to Very Far range. The beam has a width of Close range. Each PC in this area must make an Agility Reaction Roll. Targets who fail take <strong>4d12+12</strong> direct magic damage. Targets who succeed take half damage. Xero can't use this feature again until it takes Severe damage.</p>",
